":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":346,"closed_issues":2304,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:34:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":60,"created_at":"2025-12-18T19:07:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T22:10:55Z","closed_at":"2026-07-13T19:00:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114168","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-13T19:00:48Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13232 .\r\n\r\nThis PR adds support for \"Code Actions\" and \"Quick Fixes\" in Godot's script editor, for GDScript. This aims to work similarly to [VS Code's Code Actions](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editing/refactoring).\r\n\r\nEssentially, when a GDScript warning is pushed, a list of Code Actions can optionally be supplied as well. These will be offered to the user via a lightbulb icon that appears in the script editor gutter. The option to suppress the warning with `@warning_ignore` is often provided, and depending on the warning, a more specific fix may also be provided.\r\n\r\nCurrently the following fixes are provided:\r\n\r\n- UNUSED_VARIABLE\r\n  - Add underscore to variable name\r\n  - Remove variable declaration\r\n- UNUSED_PARAMETER\r\n  - Add underscore to parameter name\r\n- MISSING_TOOL\r\n  - Add `@tool`\r\n- GET_NODE_DEFAULT_WITHOUT_ONREADY\r\n  - Add `@onready`\r\n- UNUSED_PRIVATE_CLASS_VARIABLE\r\n  - Remove underscore from class variable name\r\n  - Remove class variable declaration\r\n- UNTYPED_DECLARATION\r\n  - Add type specifier\r\n- INFERRED_DECLARATION\r\n  - Add type specifier\r\n- UNUSED_LOCAL_CONSTANT\r\n  - Add underscore to constant name\r\n  - Remove constant declaration\r\n- ASSERT_ALWAYS_TRUE\r\n  - Remove assert statement\r\n- REDUNDANT_AWAIT\r\n  - Remove \"await\"\r\n- STATIC_CALLED_ON_INSTANCE\r\n  - Call from type\r\n- MISSING_AWAIT\r\n  - Add \"await\"\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cabba728-afb5-4559-8fa4-aa3b6ad5f102\r\n\r\n## TODOs\r\n\r\nNone at the moment!\r\n\r\n## For future PRs\r\n\r\nThese are things that would be nice to add in future PRs but are **out of scope for this PR:**\r\n\r\n- View and run code actions associated with warnings in the warning panel\r\n- Create function stubs to match nonexistent referenced functions\r\n- Create signals to match nonexistent referenced signals\r\n- Create properties to match nonexistent referenced properties(?)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114168/reactions","total_count":99,"+1":47,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":13,"confused":0,"heart":12,"rocket":10,"eyes":17},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114168/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}